subunit
------------------------------------------
Subunit is a streaming protocol for test results. The protocol is a binary
encoding that is easily generated and parsed. By design all the components of
the protocol conceptually fit into the xUnit TestCase->TestResult interaction.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cppunit-1.13.2-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libsubunit-devel-1.4.6-1bl1
  libsubunit0-1.4.6-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python3-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cppunit-1.13.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/testing-cabal/subunit

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/testing-cabal/subunit/archive/refs/tags/1.4.6.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack subunit-1.4.6-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./subunit-1.4.6-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/subunit-1.4.6-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/subunit-1.4.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsubunit0-1.4.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libsubunit-devel-1.4.6-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-subunit-1.4.6-X.tar.xz

